{"id": "t015-003", "text": "so I was just on the phone with Rohan and his sister Anjali got the flat in Bristol the one with the garden they viewed last weekend he said she's over the moon and um their mum is going down to help her move on the 12th", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat in Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "with the garden", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t015-010", "text": "Dalia's Iceland trip is off, her mum had a fall and she's staying home to look after her. Don't forget to check in w Dalia next week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying home to look after her", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w Dalia", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t015-012", "text": "Pedro starts his new job in Madrid on June 3rd. Him and Zoe are doing long distance for a bit, she's joining him in September. Zoe's being brave about it but she's gutted. She's trying to sell her car and sublet her room first, and her boss still hasn't said whether she can go remote. Pedro wants her to just quit and come out in July", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job in Madrid", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "long distance", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joining him", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "being brave", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July"}]}
{"id": "t015-014", "text": "Uncle Luca's 70th is in Naples on August 9, whole family's flying out. I've booked my flights already, Gatwick Friday morning. He's mad about opera so maybe tickets to San Carlo?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "opera", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "tickets to San Carlo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t015-017", "text": "quick one, Dorota's son Theo is off to uni in Edinburgh in September, first time living away. Dorota is not coping well lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t015-019", "text": "Mei's housewarming Saturday the 18th, bring wine. Her new place is in Clapham, top floor no lift", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring wine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Clapham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "top floor no lift", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t015-020", "text": "Barbara rang. Her husband had his knee done on Monday, he's home now but grumpy. She sounds exhausted. I should pop round with soup on Thursday. Their daughter's flying back from Toronto on the 14th to help for a couple of weeks, which should take the pressure off, but Barbara says she hasn't slept properly since the surgery", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his knee done", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grumpy", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Toronto", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't slept properly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the surgery"}]}
{"id": "t015-026", "text": "Lars back from Tokyo, said the flight back was a nightmare, 3 hr delay in Doha. Jet lagged but loved it. He's obsessed with Japanese whisky now", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Jet lagged", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Japanese whisky", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t015-032", "text": "Seo-yeon's parents are visiting from Busan for three weeks from October 30th. She's taking them to the Lakes and then Edinburgh, she's a bit stressed about hosting. Her flat's tiny so they're in an Airbnb round the corner, and her dad doesn't eat spicy food so half her usual places are out. She asked if I knew any good Sunday roast places near Keswick", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Busan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from October 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit stressed about hosting", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat's tiny", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat spicy food", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t015-033", "text": "Weekend in Porto with the girls 11/14 to 11/17. Need to book the airport parking", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Weekend in Porto", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girls"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/14 to 11/17", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the airport parking", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t015-036", "text": "Zoe - flight to Madrid Sept 6, one way. Get her something for the flat, she mentioned wanting a proper coffee machine", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Madrid", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept 6", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get her something for the flat", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a proper coffee machine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t015-038", "text": "Pedro said Zoe's flight got moved to Sept 8. He's sorted the flat in Malasaña, two bed, tiny balcony. Says the commute is 10 min walk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to Sept 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat in Malasaña", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "two bed, tiny balcony", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t015-040", "text": "Lunch with Anjali and Rohan. She's settling in Bristol, joined a running club. He's training for the Berlin marathon in Sept 2027. Their dad's 60th is March 15th, Anjali's organising, Rohan's paying lol. Thinking a long weekend in Goa, their dad grew up there and hasn't been back since 1998. Anjali wants me to keep it quiet if I see their mum. Should ask Rohan on Friday if they need help with the flights", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "settling in Bristol", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Sept 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "60th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 15th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long weekend in Goa", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "grew up there", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 1998"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Rohan on Friday if they need help with the flights", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t015-041", "text": "Jasmine's moving date is 6/30. Pickle's going to stay with her mum for the week cos he hates the car. Should offer to help with boxes the weekend before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving date", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pickle", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help with boxes", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t015-045", "text": "um just talked to Imani her brother Sam is coming over from Nairobi for a month on June 10th and she wants to take him to the Highlands but she doesn't drive so she asked if I knew anyone with a car I said I'd ask Cem", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Nairobi", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 10th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "take him to the Highlands", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drive", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t015-050", "text": "Adaeze's leaving do is cancelled, she's flying out early because her grandad's not well. Text her before she leaves on Tuesday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "not well", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she leaves", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t015-053", "text": "Long chat with Kasia on the phone. She's sorted most of the Lyon move, the removal firm's booked for March 2nd 2027 and her boyfriend Luca is driving the car down with the cat a week later. The new job is a big step up, she'll be running the paediatric ward, and she admitted she's a bit terrified about the French. I said I'd send her my old Duolingo tips. Should ring her after the first week to see how it's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Lyon move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2nd 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week later", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "running the paediatric ward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit terrified about the French", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her after the first week to see how it's going", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the first week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t015-055", "text": "bumped into Julien at the station, he's off to Paris for his gran's 90th this weekend. Svetlana's not going, too far along to travel", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Paris", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t015-056", "text": "Zoe landed fine. Says Madrid's boiling and the flat is lovely. Pedro already got her a coffee machine so scrap that, maybe plants?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "landed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "plants", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t015-060", "text": "Spoke to Lars, Rohan and Amir about a lads' trip. Lars wants Iceland, Rohan wants Lisbon, Amir can't do anything before March 2027 because of his exams. Rohan's going to do a poll. I'm keeping my diary free for the last week of March, and need to check my passport expiry date because I think it runs out 2027 too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lads' trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before March 2027"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last week of March"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check my passport expiry date", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2027"}]}
